  {
   "nodeId": "4674ebfb-3f16-4cf9-ae00-043180f4a816",
   "name": "FullRunDebugSummary",
   "type": "artifact",
   "metadata": {
    "parameters": {
     "type": "markdown",
     "input": {
      "content": "# Full Run Debug Summary\n\n## Findings\n```\n{{[0a0de8aa-110d-4a34-99e4-467504206593].[findings]}}\n```\n\n## FindIssue Results (per finding)\n```\n{{[0a0de8aa-110d-4a34-99e4-467504206593].[find_issue_results]}}\n```\n\n## Affected Hosts From Query (per finding)\n```\n{{[0a0de8aa-110d-4a34-99e4-467504206593].[affected_hosts_query]}}\n```\n\n---\nNote: extracted_existing_hosts, jq_comparisons, parsed_added_removed, matched_issues_enriched, created_added_tickets, and ticket_update_details are NOT included here - ICON errors when a Loop Output references a step that didn't run on a given iteration, and those steps only run on some branches. Grab those individually per-finding when needed.\n\n\n---\n\n## Reverse Sync: All Open Tickets Checked\n```\n{{[49e0d723-1a47-4e1e-8b04-1020eee1eee8].[issues]}}\n```\n\n## Stale Tickets Closed This Run\n```\n{{[79acb971-1485-4c9e-aae9-5653d537a6c0].[stale_ticket_closures]}}\n```\n"
     }
    },
    "isDisabled": false
   }
  },
  {
   "nodeId": "49e0d723-1a47-4e1e-8b04-1020eee1eee8",
   "name": "FindAllOpenTickets",
   "description": "",
   "type": "action",
   "metadata": {
    "parameters": {
     "input": {
      "jql": "project = {{[$input].[ProjectID]}} AND status != {{[$input].[CompletedIssueStatus]}}",
      "max": 100,
      "get_attachments": false
     }
    },
    "identifier": "find_issues",
    "continueOnFailure": false,
    "isDisabled": false,
    "plugin": {
     "name": "jira",
     "vendor": "rapid7",
     "version": "6.7.1"
    },
    "connectionId": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_JIRA_CONNECTION_ID",
    "isCloud": true,
    "connectionType": "CONNECTION"
   }
  },
  {
   "nodeId": "8f5bd6d7-7888-4d83-8c91-cc49df6d537a",
   "name": "CheckStaleTickets",
   "description": "",
   "type": "action",
   "metadata": {
    "parameters": {
     "input": {
      "flags": [
       "-c"
      ],
      "filter": "(.findings | map(.title)) as $titles\n| {\n    stale_tickets: [ .tickets[]\n      | . as $t\n      | ($t.summary // \"\") as $s\n      | ($t.description // \"\") as $d\n      | ($titles | any(. as $x | $s | contains($x))) as $title_present\n      | (if ($d | test(\"\\\\[AFFECTED-HOSTS\\\\]\"))\n         then ( ($d | split(\"[AFFECTED-HOSTS]\")[1] | split(\"[/AFFECTED-HOSTS]\")[0])\n                | gsub(\"\\\\\\\\n\";\" \") | split(\"  ;  \") | map(gsub(\"^\\\\s+|\\\\s+$\";\"\")) | map(select(length>0)) | length )\n         else -1 end) as $hostcount\n      | if ($title_present | not)\n          then ($t + {close_reason: \"Closed automatically \u2014 this finding no longer appears in the latest Surface Command scan.\"})\n        elif ($hostcount == 0)\n          then ($t + {close_reason: \"Closed automatically \u2014 all affected hosts for this finding have been remediated.\"})\n        else empty end\n    ]\n  }\n",
      "json_in": {
       "tickets": "{{[49e0d723-1a47-4e1e-8b04-1020eee1eee8].[issues]}}",
       "findings": "{{[9f313df7-7cb5-4b07-919c-12a1a26aadd7].[items]}}"
      },
      "timeout": 15
     }
    },
    "identifier": "run_jq",
    "continueOnFailure": false,
    "isDisabled": false,
    "plugin": {
     "name": "jq",
     "vendor": "rapid7",
     "version": "3.0.0"
    },
    "isCloud": true,
    "connectionType": "ORCHESTRATOR"
   }
  },
